r in `PlusAddressService`, Maybe we can make `CreateFillPlusAddressSuggestion` instead take all the strings and generate all suggestions. The documentation of the function should…"],["805673aa_de538678",87,-5,1,"nit: Consider using `base::FindOrNull()`, it hides lots of iterator boilerplate."],["f3d05214_3f5dbad5",87,-5,1,"Let's add a function `std::optional<SuggestionDataSource> GetSourceToSuggest(...)` to directly determine whether we should get `kPlusAddress` or `kPlusAddress` or nothing."],["1da83493_7cf755bb",89,0,1,"anymore"],["2479129b_361235f9",87,0,1,"combine"],["319b976b_8a8616f9",87,0,1,"remove"],["325fa84c_78e1592d",90,0,1,"return (There's just one)"],["69c691fd_13eee424",87,0,0,"is this needed?"],["816ed01e_4e0ec8bd",89,0,1,"filtering"],["a3457161_d0aac2e9",87,0,1,"if"],["b13f1f01_8edc4ba0",87,0,1,"Can we get rid of this? we can directly return what we want right?"],["c3872dbb_de895ed0",87,0,1,"Make this and the remaining condition a single return statement with the ternary operator"],["cc81224c_6472b4b1",89,0,0,"Just to double check, with the new logic, all those conditions will for sure be true, but we're keeping them because the old logic calls the function, right? And I assume this will all be resolved…"],["d2eb572b_f72d750e",87,0,1,"Is this needed?"],["dc250acb_ecad8fe3",87,0,1,"Combine with the first two conditions."],["e03be361_28a14d3f",87,0,1,"Let's make this ``` if (is_manually_triggered_) { return SuggestionDataSource::kPlusAddress; } ``` to reduce the degree of nesting"],["e642545d_ea15f2a1",88,0,1,"This goes into lots of implementation details. How about: ``` // Returns the type of suggestion data this generator is supposed to fetch. // Returns `std::nullopt` if no suggestion data should be…"]],0,445],[7037045,20409,248,7.323,5.882,[[0,192]],[["",91,-17,1],["",91,-17,1],["",91,-17,1],["",38,-17,1],["",92,-17,1],["",91,-17,1],["",92,-17,1],["8ad96cd7_fe2e1b40",38,-12,1,"This logic relies `OnProfileCountryUpdate` being called before the country update has happened, which is error prone and not documented anywhere. Instead, I would update the signature of this…"],["a00008fb_b2e3d2e9",38,-12,1,"I think this logic should be encapsulated under `NameInfo`. I would introduce a OnCountryChange on NameInfo and react accordingly."],["bcbd6dc8_c042477e",5,-12,1,"Reacts to a profile country update. It informs the `NameInfo` of a country change."],["64f0177c_31c8e3e1",93,-11,1,"remove"],["a18e66e0_e7874c0c",38,-11,1,"tries"],["b0085cd1_c9f4d62f",38,-11,1,"Use ticks"],["c1d9e1bd_eb8754dd",38,-11,1,"How about: ``` const std::string old_country_code = GetCountryCode(type, old_value, app_locale); const std::string new_country_code = GetCountryCode(type, new_value, app_locale); if (old_country_code…"],["fcbd2809_7be70b52",93,-11,1,"drop"],["58d756ed_364302ba",92,-10,1,"`const`"],["a0253412_d5faabc0",38,-10,1,"I think this should be a `CHECK`."],["db06e5f3_94e4ce8c",38,-10,1,"We're almost there! Should we also react to a country change in `SetRawInfoWithVerificationStatus`?"],["390b2845_57d17de5",38,-3,1,"moving a `const` variable has no effect, it will just copy. Instead, I'd suggest to just take a const reference in `OnProfileCountryUpdate`."],["a5965913_2a742fea",38,-3,1,"Just call `GetAddressCountryCode()`."],["ab384699_714364b9",38,-3,1,"`const AddressCountryCode& old_country_code` `const AddressCountryCode& new_country_code`"],["b01f9e48_6ea24a09",38,-3,1,"`GetAddressCountryCode()`"],["b07c6866_9e2d27cc",38,-3,1,"Let's do the same as in `SetRawInfoWithVerificationStatus`?"],["b1b15127_0f3156c8",38,-3,1,"`const`"],["c1479cc7_08852415",38,-3,1,"Remove empty line"]],0,446],[7156722,20409,4,0.422,0.283,[[0,193]],[],0,447],[7156522,20409,13,0.447,0.304,[[0,194]],[["eb16f01d_a49fa792",45,0,1,"Please move this right under `if (!form_structure || !trigger_autofill_field)`"]],0,448],[7130586,20411,411,11.951,9.625,[[0,0.541,195,224],[26,0.45,1,184],[11,0.009,100,3]],[["0dde2c54_afb9518b",87,-6,1,"It's not just the call, but also the execution of the function that s synchronous. Please update the comment to reflect that."],["12ec6142_1d210a23",90,-6,1,"Remove from here since you have the check already in the helper."],["23b8b6ae_d7d342fe",8,-6,1,"Here, just create the generator directly, no need to call the delegate"],["3285bd07_0919277d",87,-6,0,"If we move this after the next early return, wouldn't it be guaranteed that this is not null (and hence we could drop the whole condition)?"],["48038cbb_491d9f4b",88,-6,1,"TODO to remove"],["499691cb_aea899e6",89,-6,1,"Add a comment above this: ``` // It is required by `autofill::SuggestionGenerator` that this function should not // filter plus addresses and should return an `autofill::Suggestion` object for //…"],["6b810f73_fdb046b2",94,-6,1,"TODO to remove"],["85cbc781_0d4a65d5",95,-6,1,"Why did you need to define this? Can't you use `test_autofill_client.h`?"],["8b773f31_7684443a",95,-6,1,"Can you make the function take a `FormStructure` and `AutofillField` argument instead of adding them as states to the fixture? Such states in the fixture makes it harder to reason about the…"],["e0fbc0a7_50059988",96,-6,1,"Remove"],["f19713b9_08a68d24",87,-6,1,"Add a comment saying this only works because `PlusAddressSuggestionGenerator::GenerateSuggestions()` is synchronous."],["01e2fb5f_94f33f19",88,-5,0,"We can get rid of this state"],["73d16aaf_ab81c774",89,-5,1,"Remove"],["94f9e2e1_3cda0392",89,-5,1,"Remove"],["a154ba2b_4f03a688",97,-5,0,"I think you can remove all of those after [my CL](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7157233) lands"],["44f2cda9_cf61b7a4",94,-2,1,"Not needed?"],["5a34b005_695c2482",98,-2,1,"remove"],["64790b83_7934b873",94,-2,1,"Do we really need a passkey here? This code will be deleted in ~6 months anyway. Given that, all the additional test boilerplate feels like overkill. Can we just leave a comment here not to add…"],["75bbce12_8c777a1b",99,-2,1,"Remove as we don't assume that anymore"],["82e091cc_df2