ther ones in the list)"],["92e7f6af_3113f045",40,-1,1,"IMO this is an API bug, feel free to link to b/472336281 which I just filed; though no timeline on a fix"],["94bab10f_9aee3814",40,-1,1,"Do you mean kCancelled, kFinished, kFailed?"],["b64bdd76_35c02b1f",110,-1,1,"Could you add a comment that this removes the subscription when the ChromeAutofillClient is destroyed?"],["baa1c8cd_746a7b27",110,-1,1,"Make this private?"],["c491eb24_76473a43",40,-1,0,"Maybe a thought for consideration, but while paused the user is in control of the browser so we probably want to return false for these states? Fine to leave for a followup though."],["d02eaa0a_76579e2c",111,-1,1,"Why not `emplace()`?"],["f2224ac1_7eccff43",111,-1,1,"const"],["3a0b5072_ec554b64",40,0,1,"nitty nit: remove?"],["54a0a687_f5ad208c",111,0,1,"const"],["8e2a6ca7_2ee7101d",40,0,1,"CHECK_DEREF (Maybe also inline directly, but that's optional)"]],0,470]]}